铠","","A Knight","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不，某人只是前来扮演一棵会说话的树的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["雾行者","","Oliver Fog","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……是我连累了你，未锈铠先生，请接受我的道歉。我为我的任性连累到了你，感到深深的愧疚与自责。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["未锈铠","","A Knight","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您是今天第二个向某人道歉的人了。某人还是同样的回答，无需向某人道歉，奥利弗先生。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["雾行者","","Oliver Fog","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我从来没有见过这个数量的魔精……这简直就像……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["看不清形态的魔精堆叠在了一起，密密麻麻地将两个人包围了起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["未锈铠","","A Knight","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"6200711","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["奥利弗先生，您似乎在发抖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["雾行者","","Oliver Fog","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……简直就像是一片看不到尽头，粘稠而漆黑的浓雾。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["雾行者","","Oliver Fog","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300701.png","audio":"0","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"t